  "changeDescription": "Unified battery-only power policy and camera power summaries; HTTP/WS token-echo redaction, closed open-failure diagnostics and quiet-activity-safe watchdog with bounded station-refresh-failure recovery. Retain native relay, capability advertisement, live-view refusal/station-release handling, command keepalive and stream lifecycle. Accept correlated passive-command replies through 12 seconds with fallback information read at 8 seconds; bounded authoritative late-effect reconciliation for attached mains floodlight writes. Validated demand-only media topology snapshots remove repeated admission roster/model work, invalidate on account/session epoch and roster topology changes, and retain independent station reservations and feed leases. Unresolved snapshot bindings now fall back to unique raw-roster camera/parent classification, preserving live-view admission while retaining availability and session-generation guards. Eligible strictly correlated -108 station wait-timeout replies resolve the facade as pending acceptance only while the transmitted late-effect job is current; authoritative observations, bounded expiry and rejection behavior for other commands/codes remain intact.",
